00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:17.320
the source has been missed. That leads to under designed remediation systems or flawed monitored

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:23.380
natural attenuation justifications. The fix is straightforward, always construct a facies controlled

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:29.260
conceptual site model supported by at least one hydraulic conductivity profile per geologic unit

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:34.660
